join Petrus (Neutral) left
join Hope (Neutral) right
- Thank him and offer to pay
	Hope: Thank you. What do I owe you?
	Petrus: For tubing that's been under a drum since 1994?
	Petrus: You can owe me nothing. That's the price.
- Offer to bring him something
	Hope: I'll bring you something.
	Petrus: Don't.
	Petrus: Come back when you need the next thing. That's how it works.
[signal arg="hearts:petrus:1"]
set {GameState.petrus_stash_open} = true
[signal arg="unlock:Petrus's stash available as a recurring resource node"]
